Z||000002||Banzai||09-11-2001||09:13 AM||||I picked up all my parking brake parts from CarParts.com, about a year ago(when they had the 30% of ads in Popular Science) I don't know if I'd use them right now.  I'd have to agree on doing the brake job.  If you don't reguarly use the parking brake the spiral screw in the caliper that is used to activate the parking brake will freeze rendering your rear brakes useless.<P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!<p>[This message has been edited by Banzai (edited 09-11-2001).]||||reg||1
